        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86442, Alexander Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Alexander Refrigerator Handle is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from several modern finishes for this stunning appliance door handle. the Alexander Appliance Pull has a classic design that will fit seamlessly into almost any decor. It comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a refrigerator or other kitchen appliance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/alexander-cabinet-pull-emtek-86424\"><b>Alexander Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Alexander Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86442-specifications.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek Alexander Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86442:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86443:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
